          <fields>
            <field>
              <name>RT0</name>
              <description>Rising trigger event configuration bit of configurable event input i
When EXTI_SECCFGR.SECi is disabled, RTx can be accessed with nonsecure and secure access.
When EXTI_SECCFGR.SECi is enabled, RTi can only be accessed with secure access. Nonsecure write to this bit i is discarded and nonsecure read returns 0.
When EXTI_PRIVCFGR.PRIVi is disabled, RTi can be accessed with unprivileged and privileged access.
When EXTI_PRIVCFGR.PRIVi is enabled, RTi can only be accessed with privileged access. Unprivileged write to this bit i is discarded. Unprivileged read returns 0.</description>
