When EXTI_SECCFGR.SECi is enabled, FPIFi can only be accessed with secure access. Nonsecure write to this FPIFi is discarded, nonsecure read returns 0.
When EXTI_PRIVCFGR.PRIVi is disabled, FPIFi can be accessed with unprivileged and privileged access.
When EXTI_PRIVCFGR.PRIVi is enabled, FPIFi can only be accessed with privileged access. Unprivileged write to this FPIFi is discarded, unprivileged read returns 0.
This bit is set when the falling edge event arrives on the configurable event line. This bit is cleared by writing 1 to it.</description>
