          <displayName>GTZC1 SRAM1 MPCBB security configuration for super-block 11 register</displayName>
          <description>The given reset value is valid when TZEN=1. The reset value is 0x00000000 when TZEN=0.
Write access to this register is secure only. Any read is allowed.
The maximum number of super blocks depends on the device</description>
