        </register>
        <register>
          <name>GTZC1_TZSC_SECCFGR1</name>
          <displayName>GTZC1 TZSC secure configuration register 1</displayName>
          <description>Write-secure access only.
This register can be written only by secure privileged transaction when corresponding GTZC1_TZSC_PRIVCFGR register signal is set to 1. If a given PRIV bit is not set, the equivalent SEC bit can be written by secure unprivileged transaction.
Read accesses are authorized for any type of transactions, secure or not, privileged or not.</description>
          <addressOffset>0x10</addressOffset>
          <size>32</size>
