Each bit WUPENi is protected against nonsecure access when WUPiSEC = 1 in PWR_SECCFGR.
Each bit WUPENi is protected against unprivileged access when WUPiSEC = 1 in PWR_SECCFGR and SPRIV = 1 in PWR_PRIVCFGR, or when WUPiSEC = 0 and NSPRIV = 1.</description>
          <addressOffset>0x14</addressOffset>
