        <register>
          <name>PWR_BDCR</name>
          <displayName>PWR backup domain control register</displayName>
          <description>System reset value: 0xUUUU UUUU
Backup domain reset
Exit of Standby mode: not affected
This register is protected against nonsecure access when VBSEC = 1 in PWR_SECCFGR.
This register is protected against unprivileged access when VBSEC = 1 and SPRIV = 1 in PWR_PRIVCFGR, or when VBSEC = 0 and NSPRIV = 1.</description>
          <addressOffset>0x24</addressOffset>
          <size>32</size>
          <access>read-write</access>
          <resetValue>0x00000000</resetValue>
          <resetMask>0xFFFFFFFF</resetMask>
