        <register>
          <name>RCC_AHB1SLPENR1</name>
          <displayName>RCC AHB1 peripheral clock enable in Sleep mode register</displayName>
          <description>This register only configures the clock gating, not the clock source itself. When a bit is set in Stop mode, the corresponding peripheral clock is enabled only when a peripheral (this one or another) requests AHB or APB clock (refer to Peripherals clock gating and autonomous mode).</description>
          <addressOffset>0x0B0</addressOffset>
